1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,553
And before you pay for any A.I., ask the same question in your own language to two or three of them.

2
00:00:06,553 --> 00:00:12,142
Chat G.P.T., DeepSeek, and an Indian one, like Sarvam's app, called Indus.

3
00:00:12,142 --> 00:00:15,543
Pay only for the one that really understands you.

4
00:00:15,543 --> 00:00:19,467
And A.I. isn't the only thing India has built for itself.

5
00:00:19,467 --> 00:00:24,030
Did you know India has its own satellite navigation, up in space?

6
00:00:24,030 --> 00:00:25,652
It's called Navik.

7
00:00:25,652 --> 00:00:29,789
So why does your phone still lean on America's G.P.S.?

8
00:00:29,789 --> 00:00:31,482
That's our next story.

9
00:00:31,482 --> 00:00:33,765
Before you go, try this tonight.

10
00:00:33,765 --> 00:00:40,294
Ask any A.I. one question in your mother tongue... and tell me in the comments which one answered best.

11
00:00:40,294 --> 00:00:41,914
I read every one.

12
00:00:41,914 --> 00:00:44,127
This is Be Practical with Kishore.

13
00:00:44,127 --> 00:00:45,224
Stay practical.

14
00:00:45,224 --> 00:00:45,840
Jai Hind.

